    {"v":"I6rxyqJ08NA","s":265.87,"e":268.03,"line":"-Why? -Lorne watches \"SNL\".","note":"Two comedians joke about their old boss, Lorne. Lorne watches SNL, his own show. Lorne + watches (with -s).","noteUa":"Двоє комиків жартують про свого колишнього боса Лорна. Лорн дивиться SNL — своє шоу. Lorne + watches (з -s).","around":[[261.83,263.19,"-...is casual."],[263.19,265.87,"-Well, you know why I got away with it and you didn't?"],[267.93,272.64,"[ Laughter ]"],[272.64,274.44,"-That's how they get you. -Touché."]]},
    {"v":"9qDW_ZKpvxI","s":1078.04,"e":1080.65,"line":"-Yes. And he watches an episode of \"Bluey.\"","note":"A guest talks about a man who is like a child with an iPad: he watches Bluey, a cartoon for kids.","noteUa":"Гість розповідає про чоловіка, який з iPad — як дитина: він дивиться «Блуї», дитячий мультик.","around":[[1071.27,1076.01,"And then if you want to set up a FaceTime, he has to find an iPad. They have to give it to him"],[1076.07,1077.98,"like he's a child that they give the iPad to."],[1080.71,1085.28,"And then... -This is one of my absolute favorite people on the planet."],[1085.35,1087.18,"-I know! That's why I didn't guess that."]]},
